@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health probe
GET {{host}}/health

### Draw into 8 groups of 4 (each group holds four different countries)
# @name createDrawEightGroups
POST {{host}}/api/draws
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupCount": 8,
  "firstName": "Aykut",
  "lastName": "Sert"
}

### Draw into 4 groups of 8 (each group holds one team of every country)
POST {{host}}/api/draws
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupCount": 4,
  "firstName": "Ayşe",
  "lastName": "Yılmaz"
}

### Read back the draw created above
GET {{host}}/api/draws/{{createDrawEightGroups.response.body.drawId}}

### List the draw history, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/draws?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

### Rejected: the league only supports 4 or 8 groups -> 400 with a field level error
POST {{host}}/api/draws
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupCount": 5,
  "firstName": "Aykut",
  "lastName": "Sert"
}

### Rejected: the name of the person drawing is required -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/draws
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupCount": 8,
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": ""
}

### Unknown draw -> 404 with the domain error code
GET {{host}}/api/draws/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
